%% View: Runtime data flow (proposed, evidence-backed)
%% Question: dsh 事件如何变成宠物动画与气泡
%% v0.2：悬浮窗形态；Solid = confirmed mechanism; inferred detail labeled
flowchart LR
    E1["dsh session log<br/>durable events: turn/start, turn/end,<br/>step/start, step/end, user/message,<br/>assistant/message, tool/call, tool/result"]
    E2["ConversationNodeDefinition.match(event)<br/>src/index.js（官方 cookbook 机制）<br/>仅当前 turn 的事件驱动（迟到 update 忽略）"]
    E3["pet-state.js 状态机<br/>start/update → 语义状态<br/>idle/loading/inferring/scoring/done/sota/error"]
    E4["pet-store.js<br/>悬浮窗唯一视图状态源<br/>终态 4000ms 回 idle · 瞬态 click/fidget 覆盖"]
    E5["mappings/harness-states.json<br/>语义状态 → 气泡文案"]
    E6["pet-art.js + overlay-view.js<br/>OVERLAY_ANIMATIONS → CSS transform 动画<br/>点击/悬停/随机闲置/拖拽（localStorage 持久化）"]
    E7["DSH Web UI 右下角悬浮窗<br/>shell.overlay（root 域常驻）<br/>鲸鱼 SVG + 气泡"]
    C1["cordis.yml config / settings.yaml<br/>pet: whale | octo | random<br/>random 按 turn id seed 选定（确定性重放）"]

    E1 -->|"append（live）或 replay（ascending seq）"| E2
    E2 -->|"start: beginTurn + 锁皮；update: onEvent"| E4
    E4 -->|"消费"| E3
    E3 -->|"语义状态 key"| E5
    E5 -->|"气泡文案"| E6
    E4 -->|"快照（petSlug/state/transient/busy）"| E6
    E6 -->|"shell.overlay 插槽渲染"| E7
    C1 -.->|"决定宠物皮肤"| E2
    E3 -.->|"eval 语义细分（loading vs scoring）为工具特征推断（medium）"| E5
